{"type":"text","timestamp":1794559289426,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf145a7ffe4CZZRU25P9R7s0","part":{"id":"prt_1d4119e1c001ugsU7Ms5jk6q6p","sessionID":"ses_e2bf145a7ffe4CZZRU25P9R7s0","messageID":"msg_1d41190300019LUeca1wNsI54P","type":"text","text":"T018 complete.\n\n## Files written\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts`\n  - Imported `COMMAND_ROWS` beside `commandRowFor`.\n  - In `commandLabel`, the child downgrade now takes its class from the row of the command actually printed: `row.mutating` when the row prints that command, otherwise the first `COMMAND_ROWS` entry whose `command` matches, otherwise `undefined` (which `parentNamedOnly` treats as writing).\n  - Added the comment: the class belongs to the command printed, not to the skill that carried it.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/render-child-session.vitest.ts`\n  - Added the case stubbing `AI_SESSION_CHILD=1` and rendering `{ skill: 'command-speckit-search', kind: 'command', command: '/doctor:speckit', policy: 'run' }` with 0.85/0.20 scores, asserting the head holds `/doctor:speckit (parent-named only)`.\n\n`tasks.md` was not edited, so T018 remains `- [ ]`.\n\n## Verify output\n\nBefore the code change:\n\n```\n× takes the class from the row of the command it prints\nAssertionError: expected 'Advisor: live; use system-spec-kit → …' to contain '/doctor:speckit (parent-named only)'\nReceived: \"Advisor: live; use system-spec-kit → /doctor:speckit (run) 0.85/0.20 pass.\"\nTest Files  1 failed (1)\n      Tests  1 failed | 11 passed (12)\n```\n\nAfter the change (`VX tests/render-child-session.vitest.ts`):\n\n```\nTest Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  12 passed (12)\n```\n\n`VX tests/command-brief-golden.vitest.ts`:\n\n```\nTest Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  13 passed (13)\n```\n\n`TC` (`npm run typecheck` in `ADV`): exit 0.\n\n## Notes\n- The working-tree diff on `render.ts` also contains another lane's pre-existing `needsMode` hunk in `commandLabel`; I left it untouched and only added the import and mutating-class block.\n- Nothing was committed, pushed, or staged. Nothing else was edited.","time":{"start":1794559286812,"end":1794559289426}}}
